{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2023-04-27 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER INCREASES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': "CLEVELAND, APRIL 27, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH),\xa0THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.48 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 12, 2023. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JUNE 2, 2023.\xa0THE DIVIDEND REPRESENTS AN 11% INCREASE OVER THE PREVIOUS QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $1.33 PER COMMON SHARE AND IS THE COMPANY'S 292NDCONSECUTIVE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND."}